      "body": "Hi Jason,\n\nI previously shared an example of a lawyer connecting intake facts, documents, and tasks with AI. This article looks at what makes that work beyond one person's desk.\n\nThe idea is that lasting gains come from shared ways of working, not just individual shortcuts. That's shaping how we help PI firms adopt AI at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/7pQJFLwtzA\n\nAt Beahm Law, what seems harder: finding a useful AI tool or making it part of the team's routine? I'd appreciate even a short reply.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
